{"id":"00015","root":"uni00015_1","name":{"ja":"アルカ・スティエル","en":"Aruka Stiel"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"アルカ・スティエル","en":"Aruka Stiel"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":15,"profile":{"ja":"過去に戦闘で身体の大部分を失った女性兵士。それを自分の意思でサイボーク化した。サイボーク化には成功したが、感情の起伏が少なくなってしまった。ふうま小太郎の仲間になったのも、兵士時代からの信念である市民を闇から守りたいと言う意思にしたがっているため。身体の大半をサイボーグ化しているが、生身の部分もあり、そこの刺激はアブソーブ出来ず、従来以上の刺激を受けてしまう。小太郎のことはご主人様や主と呼ぶ事が多く、周りを混乱させる事もしばしば。","en":"Aruka Stiel is a former female soldier who lost most of her body in combat and chose to become a cyborg. While the cyberization succeeded, it left her with diminished emotional range. She joined Fuuma Kotaro's group out of a lifelong conviction to protect civilians from darkness, a belief forged during her soldier days. Though the majority of her body is cybernetic, she retains some flesh, which cannot absorb stimuli and instead receives amplified sensations. She often refers to Kotaro as \"master\" or \"lord,\" frequently causing confusion among those around her."},"illustrator":"新堂エル","voiceActor":"星もえる","forms":[{"id":"uni00015_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1122,2244],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[165,330],"def":[152,304],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","48"]},{"id":"uni00015_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1644,3288],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[255,510],"def":[229,458],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","48","49"]},{"id":"uni00015_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2166,4322],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[345,692],"def":[306,613],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","48","49","50"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":